      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Scoring (daily, hiring source only for now)\nPure DB computation via 2 SQL functions - no external API calls, no credit cost.\n1. compute_hiring_signals(): derives stale_posting/multi_role/lone_engineer/\n   contract_language from job_postings, idempotent (skips if an active\n   non-expired signal already exists), 30-day expiry on all 4 (not spec-stated,\n   user-confirmed default).\n2. score_hiring_contacts(): sums active signals + title_class/company_band\n   bonuses + role-email penalty, sets score/tier, suppresses competitors.\nVerified against 4 hand-calculated synthetic cases before going live - all\nmatched exactly (see project memory).\nOther 10 sources not scored yet - only hiring has signals/contacts to score.",
        "height": 272,
        "width": 624,
        "color": 7
      },
